---
import { site } from '@/config/site';
---
<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-blob blob-1"></div>
    <div class="hero-blob blob-2"></div>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-tag"><span class="hero-tag-dot"></span>Shopify Partner · Colombia 🇨🇴</div>
      <h1>Tu tienda<br><span class="sh">Shopify</span><br><em>que sí vende.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">Somos Shopify Partners registrados con 2 años de experiencia en e-commerce. Diseñamos, lanzamos y escalamos tu tienda con la plataforma #1 del mundo, adaptada al mercado colombiano.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href={site.whatsapp} class="btn btn-shopify" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Quiero mi tienda Shopify →</a>
        <a href="/shopify/" class="btn btn-ghost">¿Por qué Shopify?</a>
      </div>
      <div class="partner-hero-badge">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 109 124" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M95.2 23.5c-.1-.7-.7-1.1-1.2-1.2-.5 0-10.5-.8-10.5-.8s-7-7-7.7-7.7c-.7-.7-2.1-.5-2.7-.3l-3.4 1.1C67.7 9.6 64.5 7 60.4 7c-.1 0-.2 0-.4.1C59 5.3 57.2 4.5 55.7 4.5c-12.6 0-18.6 15.7-20.5 23.7l-8.8 2.7c-2.7.9-2.8.9-3.1 3.5L13 117l68.2 11.8L108 123S95.3 24.2 95.2 23.5zM68.5 16.3c-1.6.5-3.4 1.1-5.3 1.6-.1-5.9-.8-10.3-3.1-13.3 3.7.9 6.2 5 8.4 11.7zm-9 2.8c-3.5 1.1-7.4 2.3-11.3 3.5 1.1-4.2 3.2-8.3 5.7-11 1-1.1 2.4-2.3 3.9-3.1 1.6 2.9 1.7 7 1.7 10.6zm-6.2-14.5c1.3 0 2.4.4 3.3 1.3-1.4.7-2.7 1.8-3.8 3.2-3.1 3.3-5.5 8.5-6.5 13.4l-9.5 2.9C38.5 18.6 44 4.6 53.3 4.6z" fill="#8ABF3A"/><path d="M94 22.3c-.5 0-10.5-.8-10.5-.8s-7-7-7.7-7.7c-.3-.3-.6-.4-1-.4L81.2 129l26.8-5.9S95.2 24 95.1 23.5c-.1-.6-.6-1.1-1.1-1.2z" fill="#6a9429"/><path d="M60.4 42.6l-3.3 12.3s-3.6-1.7-8-.4c-6.4 2-6.5 7-6.5 7 0 7.2 18.8 8.8 19.8 25.8.8 13.3-7 22.4-18.3 23.1-13.5.8-20.3-7.1-20.3-7.1l2.8-11.8s7.2 5.4 12.9 5.1c3.7-.2 5.1-3.3 4.9-5.5-.1-9.4-15.5-8.8-16.4-24.4C27.2 52 36 37.4 55.6 36.2c7.7-.5 11.6 1.4 11.6 1.4l-6.8 5z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
        <span>Somos <strong>Shopify Partners registrados</strong> — acceso directo a herramientas, recursos y soporte oficial de Shopify para tu tienda</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-scroll"><div class="scroll-line"></div><span>scroll</span></div>
  </section>
